-- What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller?
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the licensee or seller` `selling or supplying to a person under 18 on licensed premises, as the licensee or a manager (s 121(1)(a), (b))` EQUALS amount 15000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the licensee or seller` `a person under 18 on licensed premises, as another employee or agent who permitted it (s 121(4)(b))` EQUALS amount 6000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the licensee or seller` `a person under 18 on licensed premises, as the licensee, or a manager who permitted it (s 121(4)(a), (b))` EQUALS amount 15000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the licensee or seller` `permitting a sale or supply to a person under 18 on licensed premises (s 121(1)(d))` EQUALS amount 3000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the young person` `an unasked business offence` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for this offence as a licensee or seller` `as the adult` `an unasked business offence` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
